  "raw": {
    "https://www.uj.edu/academics/internships-and-career-preparation/": {
      "title": "Internships and Career Preparation",
      "description": "Internships and Career Preparation - University of Jamestown Skip to main site navigation Skip to main content Visit the homepage Apply Get Info Visit Info for Parents and Families Alumni & Friends Current Students Employees Accepted Students Explore UJ Alumni & Friends Athletics News Events Giving Academics All Programs Undergraduate Studies Graduate Studies Online Programs Research and InSPIRE Study Abroad Internships and Career Preparation Academic Support Academic Calendar Academic Catalog Library Admission & Aid Visit & Tour Request Info How to Apply Financial Aid & Scholarships Tuition, Fees & Payment Accepted Students Student Life Living in Jamestown Campus and Facilities Housing and Dining Athletics & Recreation Performing Arts Clubs, Groups & Organizations Student Support and Resources Health, Wellness and Spiritual Life Public Safety About Mission and History President & Leadership Faculty and Staff Directory Emeriti Department & Office Directory Accreditation Policies, Handbooks, and Forms Public Disclosures Job Opportunities Contact Us Academics Internships and Career Preparation Internships and Career Preparation More In This Section Academics All Programs Undergraduate Studies General Education Requirements Choosing a Major Honors Program Teacher Education Program Graduate Studies Online Programs Research and InSPIRE Study Abroad Internships and Career Preparation Job Searches Academic Support The Writing Center Tutoring and Study Sessions Disability Services Academic Calendar Final Exam Schedule Academic Catalog Library For Students For Faculty & Staff Library & Research Help Services About the Libraries Hours & Events A successful career starts when you’re a student. A lot of the experience and planning you need to thrive in your career should happen long before graduation. That’s where our Career Center comes in. We’re dedicated to your individual, professional success. Our team is available to help you find an internship, prepare for graduate school, and begin your career. Whether you’re researching internship opportunities, preparing for interviews, or exploring different employers and locations, we’re with you every step of the way. Career Services We offer career services, both in-person and virtually, to help you learn about the nature of different careers, the training they require, job outlook, earning potential, and other valuable information. Personal assessment Our staff meets one-on-one with students to perform a personal assessment of you and your goals. This assessment, coupled with occupational, employer, and geographic research, can provide valuable information that will help you make a wise occupational choice and set realistic career goals. UJ Foundations This required course for UJ students includes topics like: career search, résumé building, study abroad, and experiential education. Professional mentoring and job shadowing These services are available with community partners and alumni in various career sectors. For professional mentoring, please fill out this form . For job shadowing, please fill out this form to begin the process. On-campus career fairs Each year, we have a fall career fair, employer tables and on-campus interview opportunities. These events give students the chance to meet employers. Merit Pages This website is an institution-verified digital page for each student to showcase their achievements from enrollment through graduation. Focus 2 This online system helps you identify your strengths, weakness, and career interests—and then matches your skill gaps and goals with UJ courses. Application preparation Learn how to build your résumé, cover letter, and LinkedIn Profile. We’ll help you on your job search and make sure you are prepared for your interview. Resume and Career Resources Job Search Learn by doing. Our Internship Program helps you get an idea of what it’s like to work in different professions, as well as gain hands-on work experience—all so you can make informed career choices after you graduate. Internships are so valuable to your future success, that many of our programs require one to graduate. Supervised internships of a semester or more in length are available, both locally in Jamestown, as well in your hometown. Your faculty advisor will work with you to research potential work experiences. And our Career Center can assist you in setting up your approved internship to earn credits towards your degree. Job shadowing in pre-professional programs is also available for academic internship credit. Most for-credit internships are managed through the Career Center in Raugust Library. To apply for an internship: Contact careers@uj.edu to set up an approved internship Complete the Internship Application Register for your internship class. This flexible course earns you academic credit for your internship. Students write reflective papers, polish off their resume, and participate in supervisor and student evaluations. Other course work may be required relative to your internship and degree path. Not sure where to start? Planning for your career can feel overwhelming. Take the first step and reach out to our team for help. Heidi Larson Associate Vice President of Career Center and Employer Relations Professor 701-252-3467 hlarson@uj.edu Career Center The Career Center is open M-F, from 8:30 a.m. – 5 p.m. in Raugust Library in rooms 110 and 115. 701-252-3467 ext. 5520 careers@uj.edu Ready to Take the Next Step? Apply Request Info Visit & Tour Visit the homepage JAMESTOWN 6000 College Lane Jamestown, ND 58405 (701) 252 – 3467 PHOENIX 4405 East Cotton Center Blvd, Ste 120 Phoenix AZ 85040 (701)557-8071 FARGO Physical Therapy 4190 26th Ave. S. Fargo, ND 58104 (701)356-2136 Graduate and Professional Studies 4840 23 rd Avenue South Suite 204 Fargo, ND 58104 (701)557-8071 TTY/TDD services 1-800-366-6888 (701) 252-3467 Facebook Instagram Twitter Youtube LinkedIn ©2026 University of Jamestown Privacy Policy Library Programs Department & Office Directory Faculty & Staff Directory MyUJ Technology Helpdesk (IT) Athletics Accreditation Job Opportunities We Care Report Bookstore Reiland Box Office"
    },
